{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/46433-translation-guide","id":46433,"title":"Translation guide","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-10T12:49:15-08:00","id":46433,"title":"Translation guide","content":"Hi as I just saw on the schedule that the translation guide is also relatively near, I wanted to ask a question there (as I need that info for one chronicle):<br /> <br /> As from what I understood it will also contain infos of how to play fallen in nwod,<br /> I wondered if there are plans to include also rules for the pull of the abyss and/or the ability to devour one another (which the demons in DTF had both, but the demons in DTD dont have originally).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:10:56-08:00","id":46480,"title":"","content":"Looking at the DtF rules, I would go with the following.<br /> <br /> If a host is destroyed, the demon manifests in her apocalyptic form hovering above the former body. The demon may move Willpower + 5 miles each turn and is unable to interact with physical objects or laws (such as gravity).<br /> <br /> Each turn the demon exists in the physical realm, she must succeed on a Resolve + Composure roll to prevent from being pulled into the Abyss. Willpower may be spent to add 3 dice to this roll.<br /> <br /> The contested roll to consume a demon is unchanged from the rules on page 260 of DtF. If the a demon is consumed, the storyteller rolls the victorious demon's faith trait. Each success adds to the faith total of the demon. These consumed faith totals can be spent on a) 5 experiences that can only be spent on Skills, Attributes, or lost dots of Willpower; a memory or item of knowledge (relics, true names, etc) known to the devoured demon; two faith points can be spent to boost the demon's permanent faith rating by one, which gives a corresponding dot of lore (or embed/exploit if you're using that) known by the consumed demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:13:52-08:00","id":46486,"title":"","content":"Those two rules were only examples <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I also have a few ideas in mind but if they are in the tralsation guide I wont do the work ymself^^<br /> <br /> as for:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The contested roll to consume a demon is unchanged from the rules on page 260 of DtF. If the a demon is consumed, the storyteller rolls the victorious demon's faith trait. Each success adds to the faith total of the demon. These consumed faith totals can be spent on a) 5 experiences that can only be spent on Skills, Attributes, or lost dots of Willpower; a memory or item of knowledge (relics, true names, etc) known to the devoured demon; two faith points can be spent to boost the demon's permanent faith rating by one, which gives a corresponding dot of lore (or embed/exploit if you're using that) known by the consumed demon. </div> </div> </div>That would be way too powerful. In owod that rule was about as powerful as diablerie (I think slightly more powerful but only slightly). with 5 experiences per faith succ that would be one hell of a xp gainer compared to how diablerie is now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:48:10-08:00","id":46514,"title":"","content":"I'll have to re-read the new diablerie rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-11T03:24:50-08:00","id":46820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/46433-translation-guide?p=46514#post46514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll have to re-read the new diablerie rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>it gives 1 xp (limited to increasing a specific thing) and 1 discipline dot or skill dot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":914,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","user":"Ryu","date":". 01-11-2014, 06:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","tit